  "request": {
    "input": "search_query: Dear Northwind Outdoor Support Team,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to kindly inquire about a recent charge on my statement. I recently purchased a high-quality tent from your online store, which I have truly enjoyed using during my last camping trip. However, I noticed an additional fee of $4.50 listed as a foreign transaction charge. I understand that your policy states these fees are charged by my bank, not by your company, and I fully respect that distinction. \n\nThat said, as a loyal customer who has shopped with you for several years, I was wondering if there might be any flexibility in this situation. I am not asking for a waiver of the bank\u2019s fee itself, but rather if there is any way you could assist me in disputing this specific charge with my financial institution, or perhaps offer a small credit to my account to offset this unexpected cost. I know this is a special request, and I completely understand if it falls outside your standard procedures. I simply wanted to ask politely to see if there is any room for accommodation. Thank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nArthur",
